# 012 · Version checks between control and rigs

**Status:** `READY` · **Version:** [v0.1.0](../roadmap.md#v010) · **Part:** Install from images · **Depends on:** [010](010-published-images.goal)

## What

Control and every rig report their versions. Control shows a rig that is behind it, refuses a rig that it cannot work with, and shows a rig that stopped reporting as offline or stale.

## Why

With published images, control and its rigs will run different versions.

## Done when

- [ ] A rig on an older, compatible version shows a notice.
- [ ] An incompatible rig is refused, with the reason.
- [ ] Tests cover both cases and the offline state.

## Decisions

None yet.

## Open questions

None.

## Progress

- 2026-10-19: Goal written from the v0.1.0 release plan.

